config BR2_PACKAGE_GAMEMODE
	bool "gamemode"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_SYSTEMD # sd-bus
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_DBUS
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_POLKIT # the CPU governor helper runs via pkexec
	select BR2_PACKAGE_INIH
	help
	  Feral's GameMode: while a game runs, switch the CPU governor
	  to performance, raise the game's priority and inhibit the
	  screensaver. Steam and Lutris request it; Flatpak games reach
	  it through the GameMode portal (xdg-desktop-portal already
	  offers that interface, which needs this daemon behind it).

	  https://github.com/FeralInteractive/gamemode
